 "slug": "gta-cheat-codes/c06",
 "chapter": "The choice",
 "topic": "What if GTA6 cheat codes worked in real life?",
 "script": [
  {
   "beat": "p1",
   "text": "\"We'll take that,\" he says. \"And you'll come with us. Just for a few questions.\""
  },
  {
   "beat": "p2",
   "text": "A few questions. You know what that means. You're the only person on Earth who can make money, cars and energy out of nothing. Nobody is letting you go home."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p3",
   "text": "Mum steps between you and the man. \"He's fourteen,\" she says. \"He's not going anywhere.\" Two more men get out of the cars."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p4",
   "text": "Ellie is on the stairs in her pajamas. She's crying."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p5",
   "text": "You can't run. And invincible doesn't help when the problem isn't hurting you. It's taking you. You could make a hundred bags of money, or a hundred cars. Nothing on that list makes people forget."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p6",
   "text": "So you grab the controller, run up to your room and lock the door. You pull out the list and press it flat against the window."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p7",
   "text": "And with the evening sun shining through the paper, you can finally read the word under the scribbles."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p8",
   "text": "Reset."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p9",
   "text": "Downstairs, the front door opens. Footsteps on the stairs."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p10",
   "text": "\"Don't do anything stupid,\" the man says through the door."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p11",
   "text": "Ellie says your name. Your phone buzzes again. Mo. \"Whatever you're about to do, don't.\""
  },
  {
   "beat": "p12",
   "text": "You don't know what reset means. Reset the cheats? Reset the house? Reset you?"
  },
  {
   "beat": "p13",
   "text": "But it's the only code left that might fix everything."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p14",
   "text": "So you enter it. Red. Red. Down. Blue. Up."
  }
 ],
